OL,3,GNEWSAFour key takeaways from the
OL,4,ADrumcree dispute so far
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor a number of years in the 1990s, the
OL,7,FDrumcree parade dispute was one of the
OL,8,Fbiggest stories in Northern Ireland -
OL,9,Fand then, for 28 years, it fell out of
OL,10,Fthe public eye.
OL,12,FHowever, that changed when the Parades
OL,13,FCommission ruled that the march on
OL,14,FSunday 27 September could go ahead with
OL,15,Frestrictions in place.
OL,17,FThat parade did not happen and, after a
OL,18,Fseries of legal challenges and talks
OL,19,Fbetween residents and Orangemen, the
OL,20,Fsecretary of state banned the
OL,21,Fprocession.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
