OL,3,GNEWSAFour key takeaways from the
OL,4,ADrumcree dispute so far
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday, a High Court judge said a
OL,7,Flegal appeal by Orangemen following the
OL,8,Fsecretary of state's decision was not
OL,9,Fan emergency case and adjourned the
OL,10,Fhearing until Monday.
